The inherited Python sender is a modified adaptation, not an unmodified
upstream product. Project changes include Windows/Tk UI and tray support,
output routing/recovery, Windows master-volume notifications, proportional
per-speaker gains, per-receiver maximum levels, bounded capture queues,
fail-closed receiver-proof verification, tests and documentation.
